<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>黑马点评 on Ruoke Zhang</title><link>http://localhost:1313/categories/%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%82%B9%E8%AF%84/</link><description>Recent content in 黑马点评 on Ruoke Zhang</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="http://localhost:1313/categories/%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%82%B9%E8%AF%84/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Session登录</title><link>http://localhost:1313/post/session/</link><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/post/session/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="黑马点评登录">黑马点评登录
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e9%bb%91%e9%a9%ac%e7%82%b9%e8%af%84%e7%99%bb%e5%bd%95">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;h3 id="第一次请求获取验证码">第一次请求：获取验证码
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#%e7%ac%ac%e4%b8%80%e6%ac%a1%e8%af%b7%e6%b1%82%e8%8e%b7%e5%8f%96%e9%aa%8c%e8%af%81%e7%a0%81">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h3>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#1e66f5;font-weight:bold">@PostMapping&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#40a02b">&amp;#34;/login&amp;#34;&lt;/span>)
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#d20f39">public&lt;/span> Result &lt;span style="color:#1e66f5">login&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#1e66f5;font-weight:bold">@RequestBody&lt;/span> LoginFormDTO loginFormDTO, HttpSession session){
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> &lt;span style="color:#8839ef">return&lt;/span> userService.&lt;span style="color:#1e66f5">login&lt;/span>(loginFormDTO, session);
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span> }
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>后端为其生成随机验证码，并且存入 session&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">
&lt;table style="border-spacing:0;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">&lt;tr>&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code>&lt;span style="white-space:pre;-webkit-user-select:none;user-select:none;margin-right:0.4em;padding:0 0.4em 0 0.4em;color:#8c8fa1">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;padding:0;margin:0;border:0;;width:100%">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#4c4f69;background-color:#eff1f5;-moz-tab-size:2;-o-tab-size:2;tab-size:2;">&lt;code class="language-java" data-lang="java">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>session.&lt;span style="color:#1e66f5">setAttribute&lt;/span>(&lt;span style="color:#40a02b">&amp;#34;code&amp;#34;&lt;/span>, code);
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>后端接着把Session ID通过 set cookie返回给前端浏览器。浏览器保存这个 Session ID, 把它存在 cookie 里面。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>